[00:29.66]I thought I would know it
[00:32.04]When it finally came
[00:33.26]A clean little answer
[00:34.40]With a beautiful name
[00:35.58]But it leaned out of focus
[00:36.88]It refused to be aligned
[00:38.20]A little out of place
[00:39.40]A little too alive
[00:40.56]Not soft
[00:41.28]Not hard
[00:41.84]Not shadow
[00:42.42]Not flame
[00:43.04]More like a strange face
[00:44.32]I could not stop seeing
[00:45.70]This is the shape it chose
[00:48.42]Not beautiful at first
[00:49.84]Not easy to explain
[00:51.12]A little out of line
[00:52.34]But impossible to leave
[00:53.86]Strange under light
[00:58.36]Uneven and alive
[01:00.30]Still becoming
[01:01.38]Still becoming
[01:14.96]The flute moved first
[01:15.80]Like a thought in the air
[01:16.98]Then the guitar answered
[01:18.24]From somewhere unclear
[01:19.46]No anger
[01:20.10]No blade
[01:20.76]Just two strange lines
[01:22.42]Refusing to fade
[01:24.30]The keys opened slowly
[01:25.64]Like a signal from far
[01:27.08]Something ancient
[01:28.12]Wearing something new
[02:09.10]Some things become living
[02:10.28]By losing their frame
[02:12.28]What changed its form
[02:13.96]Did not disappear
[02:15.22]It chose another surface
[02:18.38]And stayed moving here
[02:23.81]This is the shape it chose
[02:27.25]Not beautiful at first
[02:28.73]Not easy to explain
[02:30.01]A little out of line
[02:31.23]But impossible to leave
[02:32.79]Strange under light
